<title>UK: LIFFEE April certified coffee stocks up slightly.</title>
<headline>LIFFEE April certified coffee stocks up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rose to 4,858 five-tonne lots in April from 4,008 in March, traders said, quoting data from the exchange.</p>
<p>There was no immediate confirmation from LIFFE. Traders said the 850-lot increase was slightly below expectations. As forecast, the bulk of the increase was seen in LIFFE warehouses in the U.S. city of New Orleans.</p>
</text>
